> My AC is horribly low, I know.

And it needs to be fixed now! So take 4 attack vectors on it:

1) Buy as much protection as you can.
2) Convert the minetown altar and sacfest for more protection (be sure
to put away your luckstone. You'll get protection faster)
3) polypile to get enchant armor and hopefully more magic markers. Then
write yourself up some scrolls.
4) Find more armor. A tee-shirt for example can hold 5 more points of
protection.

